nash::names::export_open_trait

  × The `Name` trait cannot be followed by (..) like this:
   ╭─[Main.nash:1:23]
 1 │ module Main exposing (Name(..))
   ·                       ────────
 2 │ trait Name 'a where
   ╰────
  help: The (..) syntax exposes variants of a custom type. Remove the dots and name the
        trait methods explicitly when you need them.
